      1          /**
      2           *  @file
      3           *
      4           *  @defgroup   CLASS_B
      5           *
      6           *  @brief      This module implements the standard API (Application Programming Interface) for
      7           *              Freescale Kintes Motor control series MKV03x Micro module.
      8           *
      9           *  @details    This module provides the interface to the application to configure the controller and to perform the
     10           *              CLASSB safety relevant controller tests.
     11           *
     12           *              Configuring the Controller such as-
     13           *              Initializing microcontroller bus clock, configuring clock for microcontroller,
     14           *              Configures the controller to work either in slow, normal or sleep mode of operation,
     15           *              servicing Window and Independent watchdog,
     16           *              enabling/disabling or store/restoring of the interrupts,
     17           *              Providing FLASH size ,RAM size and ID of microcontroller,
     18           *              provision to detect Low voltage.
     19           *
     20           *              CLASS B safety-relevant controller test during boot as well as run time such as -
     21           *              CPU Register Test,
     22           *              Watchdog test,
     23           *              RAM test,
     24           *              Flash test
     25           *              stack test
     26           *
     27           *  @section    Applicable_Documents
     28           *              Requirement ID - 50717 - https://rm.whirlpool.oncloudone.com/rm/web#action=com.ibm.rdm.web.pages.showArtifact&artifactURI=https%3A%2F%2Frm.whirlpool.oncloudone.com%2Frm%2Fresources%2F_SuetES5PEearGv06AJXz5w&vvc.configuration=https%3A%2F%2Frm.whirlpool.oncloudone.com%2Frm%2Fcm%2Fstream%2F_qZzlsCEkEea1esD_TUzLUg&componentURI=https%3A%2F%2Frm.whirlpool.oncloudone.com%2Frm%2Frm-projects%2F_qYFucSEkEea1esD_TUzLUg%2Fcomponents%2F_qZvUQCEkEea1esD_TUzLUg
     29           *              RQM Test Plan - https://qm.whirlpool.oncloudone.com/qm/web/console/Nucleus%20(Quality%20Management)#action=com.ibm.rqm.planning.home.actionDispatcher&subAction=viewTestSuite&id=6634
     30           *
     31           *  $Header: Micro.c $
     32           *
     33           *  @copyright  Copyright 2019-$Date$. Whirlpool Corporation. All rights reserved - CONFIDENTIAL
     34           */
